  "share": {
    "x": "Stop downloading weights your RAM can't fit.\n\nllmup can-run gives a yes / slow / no verdict with estimated tok/s before you pull anything. Offline catalog, no network calls.\n\nbrew install shashankswe2020-ux/tap/local-llmup",
    "linkedin": "Stop downloading weights your RAM can't fit.\n\nlocal-llmup checks your GPU, VRAM, RAM and disk and gives every model in its offline catalog a yes / slow / no verdict with an estimated tok/s range, and the reason when it won't fit. Then it pulls, verifies and serves the one that does, across Ollama, llama.cpp, MLX and LM Studio.\n\nThe catalog: 66 models, evidence attached. Advice makes no network calls; servers bind to 127.0.0.1.\n\nbrew install shashankswe2020-ux/tap/local-llmup",
    "tiktok": "POV: you check if the model fits BEFORE the download\nbrew install shashankswe2020-ux/tap/local-llmup",
    "instagram": "Stop downloading weights your RAM can't fit.\nllmup can-run: yes / slow / no, before the download.\nbrew install shashankswe2020-ux/tap/local-llmup",
